In the program below, what value does the first pass bind to `LOOP`?

```
// Counts down from RAM[0]; stores the number of steps in R1
   @R0
   D=M
   @count
   M=D
   @steps
   M=0
(LOOP)
   @count
   D=M
   @END
   D;JLE
   @steps
   M=M+1
   @count
   M=M-1
   @LOOP
   0;JMP
(END)
   @steps
   D=M
   @R1
   M=D
(HALT)
   @HALT
   0;JMP
```

